      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STOREWIDE (8) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fourth (23.13) in a Maiden at Maitland. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Has winning claims on her best figures. ZIPPING ALBERTA (4) is still a maiden after 10 runs but rarely out of the placings, the latest filling a minor again when third at The Gardens. Has hit the frame at the last two starts. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. MULITALO (6) turned in a plain effort last time when fifth at Maitland over 450m behind Shadow Assassin (25.59) in a Mix. Was in the money prior to that. Has good early speed and can overcome the tricky draw. Expected to feature in the finish. PRINCE OF CHARM (3) can feature with the right run.",
